  1027	def test_delta_rejects_an_allowlist_entry_that_is_not_evidence(synth):
  1028	    """Wildcard-free is not enough — the allowlist must also be EXHAUSTIVE.
  1029	    A verdict that allowlists `VERSION` would wave through exactly the
  1030	    post-review bump commit that F2 is about, and every check below it would
  1031	    still report green. The refusal has to land on the allowlist itself."""
